{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Or it fall upon him.</b> From here our Rabbis said: one who kills by way of descent is exiled, for a person's way is to look ahead, and he should have been careful lest a mishap come about through his labor. But one who kills by way of ascent is not exiled, for a person is not accustomed to look behind him; therefore he is not exiled."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:44.569692782Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}